@@ -0,0 +1,18 @@
+---
+features:
+  - |
+    Over the last few releases Nova has added a new console type called
+    "spice-direct". This is a SPICE protocol native console which provides
+    a higher performance experience than the HTML5 transcoded SPICE console
+    in Horizon. You can read more about the Nova implementation at
+    https://specs.openstack.org/openstack/nova-specs/specs/2025.1/implemented/libvirt-spice-direct-consoles.html
+
+    Apart from some configuration changes to Nova, this functionality
+    requires deployment of a SPICE protocol-native proxy called Kerbside.
+    Kerbside is not an OpenStack project, but has been developed with
+    OpenStack as a primary provider of consoles (it supports several other
+    cloud options as well).
+
+    Kolla and Kolla-Ansible now support deploying Kerbside to provide access
+    to spice-direct consoles. This functionality is enabled by setting
+    ``enable_kerbside`` to ``true`` in globals.yml.
